    "body": "You are right, we need the 'requires' line you propose. Given that, the condition in the implies line isn't needed -- S must be implemented if Smctr is.\r\n\r\nFor the \"M\" requirement: you would think so ;) But, if that's the case, there is no need for Ssctr at all. Now, what you do with a system that has S but no M is a question I can't answer...",
